WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.788 --> 00:00:06.124
Welcome to quaesito! The questions go up on the TV, and every team answers right from their phone.

2
00:00:06.127 --> 00:00:11.049
Teams join by scanning the QR code, then pick a name and a picture. Easy peasy!

3
00:00:11.054 --> 00:00:13.711
Slides kick off each round. Let's go!

4
00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:17.753
First up, multiple choice! The faster you answer correctly, the more points you score.

5
00:00:18.961 --> 00:00:21.193
True or false? Quick and snappy!

6
00:00:22.694 --> 00:00:28.048
Typed answers are grouped on the big screen, so the host can judge them in a flash, even with half points!

7
00:00:29.251 --> 00:00:32.356
How many keys on a piano? The closest guess wins!

8
00:00:33.857 --> 00:00:38.001
Put them in order, oldest first! Every item in the right place scores.

9
00:00:39.502 --> 00:00:44.102
Several answers in one question, and this one is worth double points!

10
00:00:45.604 --> 00:00:48.964
Drop a pin on the picture. The closer you get, the more you win!

11
00:00:50.969 --> 00:00:54.442
Any question can show a picture, as a clue or just for fun!

12
00:00:55.944 --> 00:01:01.113
Or add a soundtrack: the clock starts with the music. Which way does this tune go?

13
00:01:04.616 --> 00:01:06.878
And the winner is… drumroll, please!

14
00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:16.064
Best of all, quaesito is free and open source. Grab it, and host your own quiz night!
